;; Kuwait (government sector) public holidays 2020-2040: external gold for KW.
;; Regenerate: uv run --no-project --with holidays==0.109 python -I scripts/generate_mena_holiday_gold.py KW
;; :days lists every holiday as (YEAR MONTH DAY NAME); any other day is not one.
(
 :country "KW"
 :generated "2026-11-28"
 :from 2020 :to 2040
 :note "Official holidays of the Kuwaiti government sector: the 13 days of Law 6/2010 art. 68 (New Year, Isra wal Mi'raj, Eid al-Fitr 3 days, Arafah, Eid al-Adha 3 days, Hijri New Year, Mawlid, 25 and 26 February) at the dates the Council of Ministers and the Civil Service Commission declared each year 2020-2026 (KUNA, Central Bank of Kuwait holiday notices), with their rest, bridge and compensation days. 1 May is no holiday. 2027-2040 are provisional: the fixed days and tabular estimates."
 :weekends ((nil 4 5) ((2007 9 1) 5 6))
