  (:title "القانون رقم 6 لسنة 2010 في شأن العمل في القطاع الأهلي، المادة 68 (الإجازات الرسمية)" :uri "https://www.alkarama.org/sites/default/files/2017-06/Law%20Of%20Labor_AR.pdf"
   :text "Private-sector paid official holidays: Hijri New Year 1, Isra wal Mi'raj 1, Eid al-Fitr 3, Waqfat Arafah 1, Eid al-Adha 3, Mawlid 1, National Day 25 Feb 1, Liberation Day 26 Feb 1, Gregorian New Year 1 (13 days). No 1 May. The government sector observes the same 13 occasions; the actual days off (moves, bridges, rest days) are fixed each time by Council of Ministers decision and CSC circular.")
